WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:08.990
Three years ago, Yuya's father vanished 
before the Action Duel Championship finals.

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:13.280
Yuya is battling the current champion Strong 
Ishijima to clear his father's name.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:18.940
During these three years, Yuya acted like a 
clown because he was afraid of being hurt.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.560
But he's overcome his issues!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.280
He's overwhelming the champion!

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:25.680
Well, that's how it seemed at first...

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.940
But it's actually tough to beat a pro.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.570
However...

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:34.570
Swing, pendulum!  Bigger!  Even bigger!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.850
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.830
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.830
Pendulum Summon!

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.280
Come out, my monsters!

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:06.370
What...

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.950
...is this?

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:17.190
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:25.560
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:29.370
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:48.150
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.560
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.300
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:04.870
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:07.070
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:12.280
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:23.090
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:29.960
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:33.900
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.300
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:47.580
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.920
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:55.560 --> 00:03:01.520
Dueling's Greatest Evolution!!
Its Name is Action Duel

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.760
We've detected a high level summoning 
signal at the city's seafront district!

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.000
Analyze it immediately!

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.740
Here are the results of the analysis!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.710
The summoning method is... Pendulum!

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:18.470
Pendulum Summon?

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.830
Three monsters simultaneously?

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:32.430
And that Dragon is Level 7!

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.830
You shouldn't be able to summon high 
Level monsters without tribute!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:41.230
But since there are no error messages 
in the system, that means...

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.710
That summoning is allowed?

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:48.630
Performapal Whip Snake's effect activates!

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:52.240
It swaps your monster's 
attack and defense points!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:00.220
Battleguard King's attack points decreased!

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.670
Next is Performapal Sword Fish's effect!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:11.470
Your monster loses 600 
attack points this turn!

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:17.190
Battleguard King had 5000 attack points, 
but it's instantly down to 500!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.340
Let's battle!

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:22.230
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon, 
attack Battleguard King!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:25.030
Show your true power!

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.250
I won't let you!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:33.350
I activate the trap card Battleguard Howling!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:39.290
The attacking monster returns to your hand, 
and you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:42.670
Timegazer Magician 
understands space and time!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.870
Protect me with your precise powers!

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:48.550
Timegazer Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:55.190
Once per turn, when you use a trap card on 
a Pendulum Monster, that trap is negated!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.510
Inverse Gear Width!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.630
Damn!  In that case...

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.020
I use the Action Spell Evasion!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.710
Stargazer Magician understands the heavens!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:14.310
Seal away the vengeful enemy 
with your profound powers!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.150
Stargazer Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:24.710
Once per turn, when my Pendulum Monster 
battles, your spell card is negated!

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.470
Horoscope Divination!

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:32.030
Action Spells are also negated!

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.710
Now, Odd-Eyes!

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:38.650
Burn everything you see with 
your different-colored eyes!

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:42.650
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:51.200
Damn!  But I'll get you next turn!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.070
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's effect!

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:58.750
When it battles a Level 5-or-above 
monster, battle damage is doubled!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.750
Reaction Force!

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.940
Doubled?

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.990
It's the end!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:31.110
He won?

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:32.790
Yeah...

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.950
I'm fired up!  I'm burning up!

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.870
Is that Ishijima?

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.070
You won!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.270
You beat Strong Ishijima in your dad's place!

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.000
Well done, Yuya!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:00.400
That was incredible, Yuya!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.150
You did it!

00:07:02.150 --> 00:07:05.150
I'm burning up!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.950
You're awesome, Yuya!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.270
I can't believe you beat 
the current champion!

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:16.510
It was amazing when a lot 
of monsters appeared!

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:18.380
I've never seen that before!

00:07:18.380 --> 00:07:21.590
Damn...  What happened?

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:26.830
Bravo!  Excellent!  Congratulations!

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.310
That was an incredible victory, Yuya!

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:33.800
Tell us about that incredible 
summoning method you used to win!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.390
Summoning method?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:51.750
President, we have confirmed 
the boy's identity.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.510
Yuya Sakaki, 14 years old.

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:57.690
He's in his second year at Maiami 
City Second Middle School.

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.150
His duel class is Junior Youth.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.660
This is his tournament record.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.830
His winning percentage is about 50%.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:09.130
Where does he study dueling?

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:13.550
He attends You Show Duel 
School within the city.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.150
You Show Duel School?

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.340
Yuya Sakaki?

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:25.390
Yes.  As you've noticed, 
he is Yusyo Sakaki's son.

00:08:25.390 --> 00:08:31.750
Yusyo Sakaki disappeared three years ago, 
and his son used an unknown summoning method?

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.470
Yuya Sakaki...

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:39.530
Do a background check immediately.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:46.070
If you find even the tiniest detail related 
to Pendulum Summoning, report it to me.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:46.930
Yes sir.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:53.990
Wow!

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.910
All these people want to attend our school?

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:03.990
If you want to attend this school, please 
fill in your name on this document.

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:04.670
Okay!

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:05.610
I'll attend!

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:06.750
Me too!

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.030
Yeah!

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.390
Yuzu!

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.670
Ayu!  Futoshi!

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:13.590
You both came!

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.350
The principal said that everyone had to come.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:19.470
But everyone means only me and Ayu.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.770
Where's the principal?

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.240
He's in the back hugging a machine.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:28.210
Thanks to Yuya, he received the 
newest Solid Vision System model.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:30.680
He's so happy that he's been 
hugging it all morning.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:35.150
Yuya truly is You Show School's savior.

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:37.190
Of course everyone loves him!

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:39.910
Pendulum Summon was cool!

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:41.750
It gives me shivers!

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.910
You'll show us Pendulum 
Summoning today, right?

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.030
Of course we will.

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:50.570
But only applicants are allowed to see it.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:51.670
I'll attend!

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.510
Me too!

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:53.550
Hurry up!

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:56.630
Please get in line in number order!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:10:02.230
Sheesh, I'm going to be the opponent in the 
mock battle, but I don't have time to get ready.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.380
Then there's no other choice!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:08.430
The man Gongenzaka will 
replace you as the opponent.

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:09.620
What?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.950
This is the principal's 
daughter's responsibility!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:16.150
It'll be embarrassing to get 
help from a rival school!

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.550
Outsiders should go away.

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.950
Outsider?

00:10:19.950 --> 00:10:23.670
We'll handle things here so that 
you can prepare for your duel.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:25.830
Thank you!  I leave it to you!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.610
You were here before.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:32.540
You came again?

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:44.590
You Show School teaches entertainment dueling 
popularized worldwide by the legendary dueling star Yusyo Sakaki.

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:48.860
When I think back a decade ago 
when Leo Corporation developed...

00:10:49.110 --> 00:10:51.390
How long is he gonna talk?

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.890
I want to see Pendulum Summon now.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.990
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:11:00.270 --> 00:11:03.230
Welcome to my one-man show today!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.680
What do you mean by one-man show?

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:09.180
You can't duel alone!

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:11.070
Who's that girl?

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:13.630
She hit Yuya!  How horrible!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.270
Leave!

00:11:17.790 --> 00:11:21.950
I see.  So that's my role?

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:26.270
Fine!  I'll take on the role of the villain!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:30.670
Yuya, just because you've gained some fame 
doesn't mean you can laugh like an idiot!

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:34.590
I'm going to pummel you into pieces!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.070
C'mon, Yuya.  Say something back!

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:45.270
Whoa!  You're Female Strong Ishijima!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.830
Female Strong?

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:51.790
You're trying to get revenge for your master?

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:54.660
I'll strike back using Pendulum Summon!

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.750
Nice!  Everyone's getting excited!

00:11:57.750 --> 00:12:01.110
Gongenzaka, turn on the Solid Vision System.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:06.740
How rude that you're treating the 
man Gongenzaka like a servant!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:12.150
The Field Spell Plain Plain activates!

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:21.070
How refreshing!

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:23.950
The new Solid Vision model is so realistic.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.430
I feel a cool breeze 
blowing through my heart.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.370
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:43.710
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:12:43.710 --> 00:12:45.840
...to move around the field!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.980
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:51.150
Action!

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:53.470
Duel!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:59.430
I'll go first!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.990
I summon Performapal Hip Hippo from my hand!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.110
The hippo appeared!

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:12.070
Yuya's strategy is to ride it 
and search for Action Cards.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:13.270
Go!

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:16.110
Okay!  You all know what's going on!

00:13:16.110 --> 00:13:17.640
I end my turn!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.510
I won't allow that!

00:13:19.510 --> 00:13:21.950
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:24.950
I summon Aria the Melodious Diva!

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.610
Battle, Aria!

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:31.550
Attack Performapal Hip Hippo!

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:35.110
Sharpness Voice!

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:42.470
I use the Action Spell Evasion!

00:13:43.310 --> 00:13:45.190
Rolling Hippo!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.710
We'll see about that!

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.590
Aria the Melodious Diva's effect activates!

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:57.480
When it fails to deal battle damage, 
you take 800 points of damage!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.180
Resonate Wave!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:12.430
Mwahahaha!  You can't escape Strong Yuzu!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.830
I end my turn!

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:16.230
Ouch...

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.070
Don't just sit there!

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:23.210
I'm acting like a villain, so 
defeat me by doing something cool.

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:25.390
I'm counting on you, Yuya!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.910
Defeat her with Pendulum!

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:31.390
Pendulum!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.240
See?  Everyone's looking forward to it!

00:14:34.240 --> 00:14:36.790
All right!  Leave it to me!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:40.510
The fun is only getting started!

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:44.030
When I said do something cool, I 
didn't mean striking a cool pose.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.070
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:48.550
It's here!

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:54.630
I don't remember what I did back then, 
so I'll do it like how I saw it on TV.

00:14:56.110 --> 00:15:03.950
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 4 Odd-Eyes 
Pendulum Dragon and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:16.870
All right!  Come, Pendulum!

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:24.020
Pendulum!

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:26.390
Here comes Pendulum Summon!

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:29.390
Come out, my monsters!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:43.430
Nothing came out.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:44.360
Why not?

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:49.590
Hey, what's going on?

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.950
Sword Fish!  Whip Snake!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.890
Come out like last time!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.640
I placed the Pendulum Cards, 
so why is there an error?

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.230
Pendulum Cards?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.610
What are those?

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.710
I need to remember...

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:13.490
Back then, Ishijima destroyed Odd-Eyes, 
so I was in a horrible pinch.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.950
I get it!  A pinch!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:22.190
A special move activates when the hero is 
in a pinch!  That's how all stories go!

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:25.760
I end my turn!

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:28.110
Yuzu, attack me!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.740
Attack?

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.970
Yeah!  Don't hold back!

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.610
Since Yuya says so, do it!

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:38.590
Attack with flair!

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:40.470
Okay.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:43.120
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:50.360
I can Special Summon this card when 
a Melodious Diva is on the field!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.750
I Special Summon Sonata the Melodious Diva!

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:59.990
I tribute Aria the Melodious Diva 
and Sonata the Melodious Diva!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:05.850
I Tribute Summon Mozarta 
the Melodious Maestra!

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:13.050
Mozarta the Melodious 
Maestra's effect activates!

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:19.850
Once per turn, I can Special Summon a Level 
4-or-below Melodious Diva from my hand!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.020
I Special Summon another 
Aria the Melodious Diva!

00:17:25.320 --> 00:17:28.250
First, I'll get rid of that hippo!

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:31.800
Aria, attack Performapal Hip Hippo!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.450
Now come!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.140
Now now come come Pendulum!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:47.450
Pendulum!

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:50.190
Don't hold back, Yuzu!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:53.320
Here I go!  Take this!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:57.050
Mozarta attacks Yuya directly!

00:18:01.190 --> 00:18:04.250
Graceful Wave!

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.300
Okay, I'm now in a pinch!

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:13.810
I Pendulum Summon!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:32.990
It's over?

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:35.120
What about the Pendulum Summon?

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.450
Ouch...

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:42.390
What's the big idea?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.790
Wait a second!  Umm...

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.520
Umm, I have a question.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.650
Yes, what is it?

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:56.120
You said something about a Pendulum Card.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.920
Pendulum Card?

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.850
That's what I call it.

00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:03.120
I don't know the official name.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.390
Show me.

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:05.250
Okay.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:09.530
This is a Pendulum Card?

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:13.450
You can't Pendulum Summon 
if you don't have this card?

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.050
That's not fair!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:18.250
Or maybe there's no such 
thing as Pendulum Summoning!

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:19.250
That's right!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.990
I bet you tricked the system 
during the Ishijima match!

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:25.850
How else could you summon 
many monsters at once?

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.720
He wanted to beat the champion that badly?

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.150
That's why he's the son of a coward.

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:34.050
No, I didn't cheat!

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.730
Wait!

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:52.120
Yuya...

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.920
Yuya isn't a coward!

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.880
Yuya didn't cheat!

00:20:02.120 --> 00:20:05.790
He fought Ishijima fair and square and won!

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.120
He won using Pendulum Summon!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:17.250
Yuya, don't you feel bad that 
your first fan has to say this?

00:20:17.250 --> 00:20:19.190
My first fan?

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:21.650
Yes.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.920
That's Tatsuya.  He visited before.

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:30.050
He became your fan after he saw 
you battle Ishijima in person.

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:32.320
That gives me shivers!

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:34.190
I thought you were incredible.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:39.650
Your dueling united thousands 
of spectators into one!

00:20:40.450 --> 00:20:43.020
I wanted to duel like that!

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:45.990
Duel like Yuya!

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:56.120
I also want to duel in front 
of a large crowd again!

00:20:56.590 --> 00:21:00.970
You were reborn in that duel!

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:02.680
You'll never run away again!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.190
Gongenzaka...

00:21:04.190 --> 00:21:06.990
So do your best for your fans!

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.990
We're your fans too!

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:14.120
Now and forever!  Right, Tatsuya?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:14.920
Yeah!

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:18.850
That means You Show School has a new member!

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:22.520
You're enrolling?  Really?  Hooray!

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:25.450
I'm fired up!  I'm burning up!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:30.590
An entertainer can't let his fans down.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:40.590
I promise to master Pendulum Summoning!

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:44.120
Yuzu and Gongenzaka, duel me!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:53.160
You want me to steal those Pendulum Cards?

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:56.390
That's right.  We don't 
care how you get them.

00:21:56.390 --> 00:22:02.250
If you can get them for us, we'll exchange 
them for any rare cards you want.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:04.320
Understood.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:19.480
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:28.960
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.850 --> 00:22:40.970
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:46.210
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:51.650
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:56.880
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:57.110 --> 00:23:02.510
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:06.930
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:12.900
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:18.310
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:23.610
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.610 --> 00:23:32.950
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:41.200
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:50.390
After training all night with Gongenzaka, 
I mastered Pendulum Summoning.

00:23:50.390 --> 00:23:53.920
Yuya, hurry up and show 
me Pendulum Summoning!

00:23:53.920 --> 00:23:56.410
Okay!  Here it comes!

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:59.090
You're Yuya Sakaki, right?

00:23:59.090 --> 00:24:04.430
I guess only the chosen one 
can use rare cards like that.

00:24:04.430 --> 00:24:06.160
Who are you?

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:11.790
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Darkville
Pendulum Summon Stolen!!

00:24:11.790 --> 00:24:14.360
The fun is only getting started!
